{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"Let You Down\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After a night of streaming illegal braindance, David wakes up to reality: a rundown apartment with a broken washing machine and an overworked mother.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8761901/screencap/6320a5f41c826.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"Let You Down / 期待を背に\"},{\"title\":\"Like a Boy\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With his newly enhanced body, David heads to the Academy seeking revenge on his bully. Later, he meets a mysterious woman who wants to recruit him.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8865679/screencap/632144cca934f.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"Like A Boy / 少年は何を思う\"},{\"title\":\"Smooth Criminal\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Surrounded by a group of rowdy edgerunners, David makes a plea to join their team. Meanwhile, sinister forces plot to lure him back to Arasaka Academy.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8865680/screencap/63214518de973.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"Smooth Criminal / 裏稼業\"},{\"title\":\"Lucky You\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Eager to learn the edgerunner ropes, David pesters Maine for another mission. Instead, Maine tasks Lucy with training him.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8865681/screencap/6321456b662fd.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"Lucky You / ツキが回って\"},{\"title\":\"All Eyez on Me\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-13\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"David makes a clever suggestion when the team strategizes for their next mission. However, he soon learns that their target can't be underestimated.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8865682/screencap/632145bdc848d.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"All Eyez On Me / 刺さる目線\"},{\"title\":\"Girl on Fire\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-13\",\"duration\":27,\"synopsis\":\"Maine doesn’t seem to be himself. But the team has bigger fish to fry: They must race against time to extract vital information from their prisoner.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8865683/screencap/6321462c3090f.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"Girl on Fire / 炎に包まれて\"},{\"title\":\"Stronger\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Now an all-star edgerunner enhanced with more cybernetics, David leads his team into a new mission. An old contact reaches out to him for a big job.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8865684/screencap/632146955a318.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"Stronger / もっと強く\"},{\"title\":\"Stay\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Faraday finds himself stuck between Arasaka and Militech. Lucy and Rebecca confront David about his change in behavior, but he refuses to listen.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8865685/screencap/63214701d99e5.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"Stay / いかないで\"},{\"title\":\"Humanity\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-13\",\"duration\":26,\"synopsis\":\"Lucy’s captors learn about her secret mission and dark past. David and his team head out to complete Faraday’s job but realize that something is off.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8865686/screencap/6321475527c05.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"Humanity / 人間らしさ\"},{\"title\":\"My Moon My Man\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-13\",\"duration\":28,\"synopsis\":\"On the edge of cyberpsychosis but determined to save Lucy, David storms into Night City as Arasaka plots to deploy their ultimate lethal weapon.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8865687/screencap/632147c11175e.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"My Moon My Man / 私の月, 私の恋\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}